      "description": "The meme uses the visual of a Black woman on a beach and the text 'i don't like the sun so i wear a visor' to imply she is 'too hot' or 'too dark' to be on the beach, which reinforces harmful anti-Black stereotypes about physical appearance and behavior. This is a form of racialized body shaming that ties into broader anti-Black stereotypes about physicality and behavior.",
